# Lazav, Wearer of Faces: "exiled with it". Turn 3 it exiles the Memnite (Bolted) from the graveyard. On turn 5 Bot1 also exiles its own
# Ornithopter with Swords to Plowshares, which is not exiled with Lazav, and Lazav exiles the Lightning Bolt card. Sacrificing a
# Clue offers only the Memnite: the Ornithopter in exile cannot be chosen (a refusal); the Memnite can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Lazav, Wearer of Faces
Memnite
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Swords to Plowshares
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lazav, Wearer of Faces.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Lightning Bolt
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lazav, Wearer of Faces > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Memnite
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Memnite; Ornithopter
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Lazav, Wearer of Faces > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Memnite; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Lazav, Wearer of Faces = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
